Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾为安布雷拉公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked for the Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世上最大最强的公司效命\N{\fnArial\fs30}the largest and most powerful commercial entity in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担任保安主任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was head of security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责保护“蜂巢”\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a secret high-tech facility called The Hive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.05,0:01:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个发展实验性生化武器的地下高科技实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}a giant underground laboratory developing experimentalviral weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但意外发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒扩散，大家都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The virus escaped and everybody died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 他们并没有完全死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble was they didn't stay dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,T病毒控制了他们的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-virus reanimated their bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和另一个人，环保份子麦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myself and one other an environmentalist named Matt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃出来时，却被安布雷拉的科学家捉住\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we emerged, we were seized by Umbrella scientists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦特和我被迫分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt and I were separated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在突变，我要把他纳入奈密司计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mutating. I want him in the Nemesis Program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.63,0:01:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她到拉昆市的机构，组一队人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the Raccoon City facility and assemble the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,重开“蜂巢”\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're reopening The Hive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道下面发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what went on down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为灾难已经过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we'd survived the horror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.51,0:02:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:09.65,Title,0,0,0,0,,《生化危机：启示录》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是拉昆第7台，现在报告气象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're watching Raccoon 7. Now the weather, with Terri Morales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是上午6：10，气温已高达33度\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 6:10 in the a.m. And already the temperature has reached　a massive 92 degrees {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这股空前的热浪将继续发威\N{\fnArial\fs30}as this unprecedented heat wave continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉昆市晴天，吹西风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear skies in Raccoon City and a light breeze coming in from the west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息，粉尘值只有0.7\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as a special bonus just for you, we have a pollen count of 0. 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.91,0:02:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个值可是同期最低\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a record low for this time of year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,花粉热、气喘病患可以安心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news for all you hay fever and asthma sufferers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来今天会是个晴朗的好日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in all, it looks like it's gonna be another beautiful day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别转台，广告后是大众喜爱的假日热点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with us. After the break, we're gonna look at your favorite holiday hot spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.53,0:02:54.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蜂巢入口 拉昆市地下）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,先遣小组前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advance team, proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:53.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑门大桥 拉昆市主要联外桥梁）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，夫人，出了点意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us, ma'am. There's been an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，先生，出了点意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us, sir. There's been an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况有多糟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must come with us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带我女儿一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must get my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有人在处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's taken care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，你干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不明白，她去上学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. She's left for school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:13.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拉昆市初中）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是UG7，完成撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is U-Gamma 7, evacuation complete{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过G12小组失去联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we just lost contact with Gamma 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:06:00.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（13小时后）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,12小队请求支援市政厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 12 calling for immediate backup at city hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.00,0:06:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前原因不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no explanation for this wave of unexplained killings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫名杀戮持续横扫本市\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is sweeping across the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪行为继续扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deadly crime spree with no end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要支援！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backup, we need backup now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟范伦婷说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Valentine told us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,休假员警立刻向执勤单位报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off-duty law enforcement personnel, report for duty immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮忙！这家伙疯了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a hand over here, this guy's insane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是范伦婷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Valentine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,范伦婷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valentine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:06:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们受到感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮我拉开这个丑女！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody get this ugly bitch off of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要射脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot for the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！快拉住她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, somebody get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！别开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't shoot! Don't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开城里，我建议你也这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving town. I suggest you do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,据报安布雷拉公司派出武装警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've received reports of Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:35.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（艾莉丝计划开始启动）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:38.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（活死人横行）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请依序通过检查站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move in an orderly fashion to security checkpoints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:09:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,本市已遭污染，军队已全面封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city is completely contained. Troops have sealed all exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的出口就是这座桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way out is this bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体市民必须通过身体扫瞄\N{\fnArial\fs30}All citizens must pass through medical scanning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.07,0:09:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族成员必须一起通过检查站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family members must pass through security checkpoints together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请依序前进，请勿奔跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please proceed in an orderly fashion. Do not run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没问题，让他过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's clean. Let him pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要推挤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pushing, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,排好队！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机D，新命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chopper Delta, new orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接飞往黑门大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed directly to Ravens Gate Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里极需支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reinforcements urgently needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，基地，马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that, base. On our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.03,0:10:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Stop! Get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有市民有麻烦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civilian in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三点钟方向，快下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three o'clock. Go down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！我们有任务！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. We have our orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get back! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了她的！快下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill her! Take us down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是老百姓，我们有任务在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a civilian. We have orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的任务！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck orders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼寇莱！绑住我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholai, tie me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们下去！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us down! Down, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.82,0:11:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站在边缘，过来我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step away from the edge. Come over to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过被咬过的人的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen what happens to you once you've been bitten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有活路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,培顿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,培顿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.05,0:12:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,范伦婷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peyton! Valentine. Hey, Valentine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！警察！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Police! Move! {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你来，我们需要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're here. We could use the help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.73,0:12:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心脏不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a weak heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠近他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, stand back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠近他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她拉开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her away from him! It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉开她！把她拉走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from him!Get her away from him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.55,0:12:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，有我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把他拉开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him off! Get him off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move aside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒已经到达闸门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here. It's reached the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.57,0:13:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还在这？你该趁早走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here? You should've got out while you had the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我们的同胞，吉儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are our people, Jill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭闸门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close them. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.91,0:13:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭闸门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our men are still out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,本区是生化危害区\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a biohazard quarantine area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于有感染危险，你们不能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Due to risk of infection, you cannot be allowed to leave the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已采取所有适当措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}All appropriate measures are being taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,状况已受到控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation is under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位请回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please return to your homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get away with this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.10,0:14:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有五秒钟的时间回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have five seconds to turn around and return to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.01,0:14:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上级已授权可使用武器驱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use of live ammunition has been authorized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能对百姓开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't shoot people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}four!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快叫他们回来！ - 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get them back! - Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, clear out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,K小队与R小队到1区会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kilo and Romeo squads, rendezvous at sector 01{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,歼灭敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and secure against enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,手榴弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade! Grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,3到7小队全数撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squads three to seven are on full retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，行动失败，无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. Suppression measures have failed. We can't contain it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,传染速度出人意料的快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infection is spreading faster than anyone anticipated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:15:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾胥佛博士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ashford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是该坐上直升机了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you be on the chopper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.05,0:16:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉命撤离你和其它科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was instructed to get you and the other scientists out of the hot zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是安布雷拉公司的重要资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too important to Umbrella to be at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有我女儿不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving without my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.73,0:16:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很对不起，但本市已经封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, truly. But the city is sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能没死，但我们找不到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She may have survived the crash, but we couldn't find her anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算她还活着，我也不能让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if she were still alive, I couldn't let her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.31,0:16:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染的危险太大了，请你谅解\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risk of infection is too great. You must understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做你该做的事，我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you have to do.I'm staying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:03.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第五级密码登入）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:05.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密码取消）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.99,0:17:12.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请求远端遥控）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拒绝登入）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:25.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（登入成功）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:39.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜寻安琪拉艾胥佛）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:42.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（在拉昆市国中寻获）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定还有人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be someone left alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.86,0:17:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:58.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜寻中）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寻获）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.96,0:18:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她到拉昆市的机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the Raccoon City facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:19:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她隔离，仔细观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her quarantined. Close observation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare her for exposure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,提升剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up the dosage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:27.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜寻中）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.53,0:19:34.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寻获）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得休息会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stop somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈究竟怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.19,0:19:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝人群中开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are shooting people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是些无辜的老百姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}innocent people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩应该做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可是警察啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.59,0:19:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.99,0:19:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get under cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们给我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躲在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hiding here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里很大，我们可以一起躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's big enough for all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,少说废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just cool it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你，别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you, take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用枪，它也会让你死在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a way to get yourself killed here, without get yourself shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是吉儿·范伦婷，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jill Valentine, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我报导过你几件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I covered some of your cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你停职之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before your suspension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰莉·莫瑞斯，第7台的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri More Alice, Raccoon 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经见过你干的所有事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen all your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.49,0:21:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,兴趣而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在播天气预报了，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did weaponry there, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是培顿·威尔斯中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Sergeant Peyton Wells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手上拿着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that you got there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的艾美奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Emmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们有人能幸存的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's if any of us make it out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方对那些玩意有何评论？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does the Raccoon City Police Department have any comment on what those things are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我主判决\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lord judgment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧，我将把恶灵带给世人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, I will bring evil upon these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不再领悟我的圣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}For they have my packened onto my words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再敬仰我主，但我拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor on my lord. But I rejected it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来吧，远离尘世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awake, leave the dwelling dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者将与活人同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead shall walk amongst the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,并给予他们惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bring the damnation onto them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,出色的演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite a speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常精彩，可以作为最后一个镜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was great. That's gonna make the final cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:22:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.61,0:23:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.55,0:23:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我妹妹，她生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my sister. She's not well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can help. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.16,0:23:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.23,0:23:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.57,0:23:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在喂养她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're feeding her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真恶心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave us alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.81,0:23:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.75,0:23:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要离开这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting out of here. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.22,0:23:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.19,0:23:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.32,0:23:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮忙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, help us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:23:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.13,0:24:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.98,0:24:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.42,0:24:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.25,0:24:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that thing? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.09,0:24:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？快回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Get back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.02,0:26:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,培顿！泰莉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peyton.Terri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.57,0:27:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,培顿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peyton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.60,0:27:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.72,0:27:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个爱尔兰学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Irish student.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.93,0:27:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他是苏格兰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No he's Scottish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.72,0:27:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.15,0:27:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算过有三只\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count three of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.52,0:27:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们困住我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got us boxed in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.16,0:27:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.05,0:27:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you get her out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.67,0:27:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.06,0:27:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need more ammo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.63,0:27:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.35,0:28:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.64,0:28:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.74,0:29:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂大赛车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}GTA, motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.92,0:29:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.82,0:29:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten points!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,长的不错啊，小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's damn looking good, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.35,0:30:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,找别人去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him to find out who's second air{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.79,0:30:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤里！你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yuri. You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.26,0:30:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃炸弹吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.04,0:31:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.18,0:31:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这边走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.95,0:31:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奥利维拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Olivera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.15,0:31:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遇袭，请派直升机撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been overrun. Request immediate chopper evac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们他妈的在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are we doing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.98,0:32:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.98,0:32:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道只有我一个人在担心我们何时会变成僵尸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only one who's not thinking we're not the grave yard people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.55,0:32:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，有什么计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. What's the point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.29,0:32:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.17,0:32:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it? That's it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.79,0:32:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hem. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.47,0:32:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找个地方暂时落脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find somewhere to stop for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.04,0:32:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不认为这可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有更多的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be more of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.25,0:32:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有的话，我们早遇上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there were more, we'd have seen them by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.95,0:32:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道它们是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.25,0:32:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,安布雷拉地下实验室的生化武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bio-weapons from Umbrella labs beneath the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.59,0:32:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么清楚安布雷拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you know so much about Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.49,0:32:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾为他们效过力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to work for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.43,0:33:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.06,0:33:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.60,0:33:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.20,0:33:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受了伤，感染正在扩大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wounded. The infection's spreading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.94,0:33:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.41,0:33:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就该解决他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should take care of him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.14,0:33:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等下去就更难解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be more difficult later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.88,0:33:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.41,0:33:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.22,0:33:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那时，我自会处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it comes to that I'll take care of it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.82,0:33:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.89,0:33:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无关个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.10,0:33:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但1个小时内，也许是两个小时，你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in an hour, maybe two you'll be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.87,0:33:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后没多久，你就会变成它们那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And moments later, you'll become one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.80,0:33:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会危及到朋友，试图杀害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll endanger your friends, try to kill them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.54,0:33:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.38,0:33:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the way it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.05,0:34:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.67,0:34:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人太多了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.94,0:34:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里！往这边走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here. This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.76,0:35:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,T病毒感染已达危急程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, T-virus infection has reached critical levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.93,0:35:18.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（感染程度危急）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.17,0:35:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个完美的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a perfect opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.97,0:35:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,务必记录所有数据资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ensure all data streams are recorded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.17,0:35:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动奈密司计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate Nemesis Program now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:27.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动复仇邪神）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.73,0:35:49.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（镇静剂-静脉注射）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.53,0:35:51.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（肌肉松弛剂-自动停止）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.63,0:36:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法呼叫基地，这是阿尔法呼叫基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfa ding to base. This is Alfa ding to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.63,0:36:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,回话，基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.93,0:36:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！集中精力，战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pay attention, solider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.63,0:36:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法呼叫基地，这是阿尔法呼叫基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfa ding to base. This Alfa ding to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.63,0:36:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,回话，基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.63,0:36:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保持注意力，好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay focus. Alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.63,0:36:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.33,0:36:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔法呼叫基地，这是阿尔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfa ding to base. This Alfa {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.33,0:36:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不回应我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes. Why don't they respond go to us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.93,0:36:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不让我们撤退，嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't they evac us, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.13,0:36:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.13,0:36:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们先送我们来这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do they send us here in the first place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.73,0:36:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有任何机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never stood a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.73,0:36:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有任何把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}We We're not sure for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.03,0:36:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.83,0:36:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.93,0:36:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！这里啊！我们在这里！嘿！过来！我们在这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Here! We're down here!Hey! Come! We're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.70,0:36:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.07,0:36:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要在那里降落，快扶尤里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're landing there. Let's get Yuri!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.64,0:36:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，尤里，我们要出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Yuri. We're getting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.34,0:36:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好好安置你的，来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you fixed up. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.66,0:37:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点，我们就快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Yuri. We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.43,0:37:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！别走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No! Don't leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.00,0:37:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！快下来！我们来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down here! We're coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.97,0:37:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们投东西到医院，你看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They dropped something on hosptial，did you see them？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.70,0:37:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a radio, One that works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.50,0:37:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾尤里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Yuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.92,0:37:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑着点，尤里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Yuri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼寇莱，放我下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholai, put me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.36,0:38:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，在这休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, rest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.53,0:38:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.97,0:38:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来像是 武器箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like weapon cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.84,0:38:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要武器，我们要撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need weapons. We need evacuation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.84,0:38:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不是给我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These weren't meant for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.57,0:39:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有的是子弹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty to go around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.76,0:39:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.19,0:39:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是神射手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.80,0:39:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了！我欠你一次！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you! Owe you one, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.94,0:40:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀，外面还比较安全咧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Maybe I was safer outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪从我脸上移开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them guns out of my damn face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.98,0:40:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，你看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker, please. Look{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家伙才正点\N{\fnArial\fs30}my shit is custom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.13,0:40:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.94,0:40:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.39,0:40:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了，大怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going down, you son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.72,0:40:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.14,0:41:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,成防卫队形，撂倒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploy defensive formation. Take him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.31,0:41:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuckers is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.64,0:41:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大怪物手上拿着火箭筒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that guy, got a rocket launcher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.45,0:41:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.45,0:41:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队武装人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dozen armed men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.98,0:41:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,组织严密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well organized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.72,0:41:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很惊讶竟然有人还能活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm surprised there's anyone left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.06,0:41:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是S.T.A.R.S.\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're S.T.A.R.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.43,0:41:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,特种战术援救小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Tactics and Rescue Squad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.26,0:41:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.37,0:41:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.45,0:41:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back! Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.25,0:41:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们有多行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how good they really are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.85,0:41:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,变更指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altering protocols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.55,0:41:56.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杀光特种战术援救小组）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.71,0:42:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不堪一击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}S.T.A.R.S.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.98,0:42:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.36,0:42:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.49,0:42:38.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（武装平民　威胁：很低）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.83,0:42:41.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（非战斗人员　威胁：零）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.58,0:42:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗日的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the white motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.08,0:42:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没权利操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no right to do shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.83,0:42:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.59,0:42:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,操，我最屌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. I'm a bad motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.93,0:43:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，我最屌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm a bad motherfucker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.43,0:43:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得离开这鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll get the fuck out of here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.23,0:43:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you staring at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.43,0:43:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.43,0:43:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进的保护伞公司？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you one of the Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.43,0:43:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,混口饭吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna make a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.73,0:43:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身手真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were some pretty slick moves back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.16,0:43:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很行，但还没有你行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good，but I'm not that good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.03,0:43:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该庆幸这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be thankful for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.50,0:43:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.04,0:43:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对我动了手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did something to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.11,0:43:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不太觉得自己是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely feel human anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.35,0:43:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.68,0:43:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁这声音还没引来怪物之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the sound attracts anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.13,0:43:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.51,0:44:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.44,0:44:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你们永远不会接电话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I thought you'd never answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.94,0:44:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.21,0:44:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你们逃出拉昆市\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you out of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.88,0:44:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All four of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.08,0:44:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先我们得做个约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first we have to come to an arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.89,0:44:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们同意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready to make a deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.42,0:44:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有选择吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.76,0:44:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，想活过今晚就得答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you want to live past tonight, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.79,0:44:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是艾胥佛博士，他负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Dr. Ashford and he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.73,0:44:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责安布雷拉的基因病毒研究部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Runs the genetics and viral research division of Umbrella Corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.83,0:44:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要我们干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he want with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.47,0:44:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他女儿安琪拉被困在城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}His daughter, Angela, is trapped in the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.97,0:44:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安布雷拉公司原本应该要撤离她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umbrella was to evac her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.14,0:44:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但行动失败，她目前躲在学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she didn't make it.She's hiding out in her school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.44,0:44:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她，他就会帮我们逃离此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find her, he'll help us escape the perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fucking deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.28,0:44:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找栋门坚墙固的建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find the building with the thickest walls and doors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.42,0:44:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,固守在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we barricade ourselves in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.15,0:44:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待救援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit tight, wait for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.82,0:44:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有人来救援的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There won't be any help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.16,0:45:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士说安布雷拉知道感染已失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umbrella knows they can't contain the infection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.03,0:45:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以等天一亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So at sunrise this morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.66,0:45:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉昆市就会被彻底消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raccoon City will be completely sanitized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.80,0:45:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫彻底消毒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean by "sanitized"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.34,0:45:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个精密的战略性核子武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A precision tactical nuclear device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.47,0:45:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力多大？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What yield? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.44,0:45:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当于五千吨炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five kilotons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.68,0:45:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,太扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck me. Stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.44,0:45:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.28,0:45:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可以摧毁感染的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means it'll destroy the infection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.52,0:45:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有所有的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all evidence of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.75,0:45:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太过份了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bullshit. It's bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.59,0:45:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不可能盖过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fucking way would they get away with that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视新闻会报导一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be all over the fucking news!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.13,0:45:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,用藉口掩饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover-up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.09,0:45:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,藉口已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover-up's already prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.93,0:45:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,核电厂的反应堆发生状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}A meltdown at the nuclear power plant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.56,0:45:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场悲剧性的意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tragic accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.63,0:45:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,安布雷拉不可能有办法掩饰一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even Umbrella is capable of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.74,0:45:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能？培顿，你当时在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not capable? Peyton, you were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在桥头\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.27,0:45:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚他们会无所不用其极\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know exactly how far Umbrella will go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.68,0:45:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.68,0:46:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们天亮前要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should be out of here by sunrise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.22,0:46:06.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜寻中）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.73,0:46:07.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寻获）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.62,0:46:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一根本没出路呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there is no way out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.83,0:46:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还变态的到处监视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's watching us on these cameras{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.08,0:46:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一种恶心的游戏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}like this is some kind of sick game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.53,0:46:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.43,0:46:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.90,0:46:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮可不会等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sunrise ain't gonna wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.04,0:46:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，下面有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.There's something down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.37,0:46:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.84,0:46:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.68,0:46:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.08,0:46:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到并不代表没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't alter the fact that there is something down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.78,0:46:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够这一切了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting sick of this bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.45,0:46:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,培顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.69,0:46:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.13,0:46:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到另外两个特种部队队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's located another two S.T.A.R.S. Members.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.06,0:46:49.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标：范伦婷 培顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.17,0:46:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇邪神，快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemesis! Run! Just go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.37,0:46:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.98,0:47:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要目标已确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primary target is identified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.78,0:47:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位，我们等待的就是这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, this is what we've been waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.52,0:47:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,2点18分27秒确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm at 2: 18 and 27 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.69,0:47:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇邪神已全面启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nemesis Program is now fully activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:28.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（垃圾投弃口）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.79,0:49:00.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（战斗中止）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.39,0:50:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm I'm sorry about your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.93,0:50:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快去学校找这个小孩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get to the school and find this kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.10,0:50:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.57,0:50:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，培顿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No，Peyton!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.33,0:50:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤口一直血流不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}it won't stop bleeding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.70,0:50:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么会没看到我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't they see us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.80,0:50:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.87,0:50:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机啊，我们就在医院前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chopper. We were right there in the street in front of the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.84,0:50:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么会看不见我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could they not see us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.68,0:50:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.38,0:51:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.25,0:51:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是资产，可牺牲的资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're assets, Nicholai.Expendable assets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.69,0:51:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们被牺牲掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've just been expended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.07,0:51:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.21,0:51:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是活死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not one of those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.68,0:51:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, remember me? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.88,0:51:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，我没被咬到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I haven't been bitten or anything. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.45,0:51:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb aboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.62,0:51:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫杰佛森韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lloyd Jefferson Wade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.79,0:51:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以叫我阿杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call me L.J. On account of the informal situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.50,0:51:53.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（寻获安琪拉艾胥佛）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.87,0:52:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得分开来找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to split up to search this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.54,0:52:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.78,0:52:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！我不要自己一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it! I'm not going out there by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.91,0:52:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以跟你一起去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.68,0:52:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搜一楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, take the first floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搜二楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, take the second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.62,0:52:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搜地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the basement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.65,0:52:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有开过枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never shot a gun before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.42,0:52:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.53,0:52:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准，射击，重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point, pull, repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.82,0:52:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,设法射他们的头部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to hit them in the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.63,0:53:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准，射击，重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point, pull, repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.93,0:53:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准，射击，重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point, pull, repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.49,0:54:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你了，死骷髅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you, mother Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.33,0:54:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，埃尔维斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Elvis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.37,0:54:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也接到电话了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you get the call as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.14,0:54:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.21,0:54:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是来找那女孩的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here for the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.48,0:54:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，是，是为那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, yeah. The girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.94,0:54:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾胥佛博士没说他还找了别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Ashford didn't say he made a deal with someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.35,0:54:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们算是伙伴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're partners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.64,0:55:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.25,0:55:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.23,0:55:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,安琪拉，不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela? It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.07,0:55:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.11,0:55:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会带你回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna take you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.18,0:55:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.64,0:56:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰莉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terri?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.32,0:56:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不了她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't help her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.69,0:56:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.86,0:56:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他们把她吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.77,0:56:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是安琪拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Angela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.17,0:56:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我们得趁他们回来前赶快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes，We should hurry before they come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.91,0:56:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.25,0:56:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫安琪拉·艾胥佛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angela Ashford, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.38,0:56:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小女孩怎么叫这么成熟的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a pretty grown-up name for a little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.92,0:57:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是小女孩，而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a little girl. Besides{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.29,0:57:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友都叫我安琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}all my friends call me Angie. 　{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.32,0:57:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,安琪？我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie, huh? I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.97,0:57:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things are in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.57,0:57:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们动作慢，我们可以绕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, honey. They're slow. We can run around them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.80,0:57:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.Not them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.18,0:57:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.11,0:57:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.24,0:57:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.78,0:57:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可能需要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you might need a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.61,0:58:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是安布雷拉公司的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work for Umbrella?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.35,0:58:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.35,0:58:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他们把我们扔在这里等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until they left us for dead in this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.68,0:58:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在算是自由工作者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I consider myself freelance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.72,0:58:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼寇莱中士为你效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Nicholai Genovev, at your service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.60,0:58:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.26,0:58:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.03,0:58:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,安琪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.60,0:58:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,去救那个女孩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.66,0:58:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付这只死母狗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.48,0:58:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起，要紧跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, stay right beside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.02,0:58:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,门被堵住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's blocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.99,0:58:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.41,0:59:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.57,0:59:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心看着，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes, Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.80,1:00:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.77,1:00:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认识？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two know each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.30,1:00:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受过感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.51,1:00:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是高度感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's infected on a massive level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.98,1:00:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.71,1:00:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she is too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.51,1:00:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也被感染了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're infected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.95,1:00:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算什么时候才告诉我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When were you gonna tell us that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.16,1:00:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.12,1:00:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.60,1:01:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm not gonna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.83,1:01:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.59,1:01:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是解毒剂，可以治愈T病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the antivirus, the cure to the T-virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.76,1:01:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有解毒剂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a cure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.63,1:01:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.50,1:01:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.93,1:01:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸帮我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy made it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.13,1:01:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他瘫痪了，有一天我也会瘫痪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's sick. And someday, I'll get sick too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.54,1:01:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想阻止那种情况发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just wanted to stop that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.31,1:01:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was little{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.67,1:01:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能拄着拐杖走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to walk on crutches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.74,1:01:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我再也不会变好了，只会变得更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said I'd never get better, just worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.92,1:01:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现了让我变强壮的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found a way to make me stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.35,1:02:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,T病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.72,1:02:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他们夺走了他的发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they took the invention away from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.36,1:02:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.77,1:02:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a bad man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.74,1:02:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无意造成这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't mean for any of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.27,1:02:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.92,1:02:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！他没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot! He's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.32,1:02:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟博士达成了协议，跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made a deal with Dr. Doom, same as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.46,1:02:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多少人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of you guys are there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.53,1:02:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.33,1:02:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼寇莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicholai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.17,1:02:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候被咬的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When were you bitten?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.17,1:02:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,三小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.21,1:02:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.95,1:03:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your lucky day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.02,1:03:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该说你被咬了，我跟你一起耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have told me you got bit. I'm hanging with you and shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.76,1:03:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟我女儿说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me speak to my daughter. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.09,1:03:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先，你得告诉我们怎么出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you tell us how we're getting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.86,1:03:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一架直升机已经在待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a helicopter already being prepped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.57,1:03:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将47分钟后起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes off in 47 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.54,1:03:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是引爆核弹前的最后一个架次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be the last transport to leave Raccoon City before they detonate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.37,1:03:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这架直升机不是来接我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it this helicopter isn't laid out just for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.04,1:03:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有别的任务，但它没人看守\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It has another purpose, but it'll be lightly guarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.95,1:03:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the evac site? {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.72,1:03:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在能跟女儿说话了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I speak to my daughter now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.49,1:03:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.02,1:03:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，甜心，你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetheart. Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.53,1:03:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么时候能看到你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When can I see you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.96,1:03:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人很快就会带你来见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people will bring you to see me. I'll see you very soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.33,1:03:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫那个姐姐来听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the lady back on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.90,1:03:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we have to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.67,1:03:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,直升机停在市政厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The helicopter will be at city hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.81,1:04:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你们动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you make haste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.15,1:04:09.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（连接失败）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.88,1:04:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑，真靠不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computers, so unreliable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.89,1:04:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.77,1:04:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really thought I didn't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.95,1:04:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我注射什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you injecting me with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.12,1:04:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,解毒剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The antivirus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.29,1:04:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,T病毒重新活化死去的细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The T-virus reanimates dead cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.89,1:04:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让死人活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, bringing the dead to life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.86,1:05:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,或让活人产生无法控制的突变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or in a living human, it can cause uncontrollable mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.30,1:05:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让她得以再度行走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it can help her walk again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.93,1:05:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要继续以这玩意控制病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the virus is kept in check with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.00,1:05:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,安琪也受到了感染？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie's infected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.24,1:05:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，细胞的成长足以让她再生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.The cellular growth is enough to regenerate her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.11,1:05:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不会让她更进一步突变\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not enough to cause mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.65,1:05:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让你也受到T病毒感染？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they infected you with the T-virus as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.51,1:05:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.48,1:05:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过别担心，我没有传染危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry. I'm not contagious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.16,1:05:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.26,1:05:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,录下整个故事，我会让它物有所用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tape the story. I'll see that it gets put to good use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.46,1:05:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Alice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.43,1:05:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾为安布雷拉公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked for the Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.34,1:05:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上最大最强的公司效命\N{\fnArial\fs30}the largest and most powerful commercial entity in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.34,1:05:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担任保安主任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was head of security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.94,1:05:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责保护“蜂巢”\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a secret high-tech facility called The Hive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.95,1:05:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个发展实验性生化武器的地下高科技实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}a giant underground laboratory developing experimental viral weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.65,1:06:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.27,1:08:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你漏了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.64,1:09:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.61,1:09:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题的，有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay. We have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.74,1:09:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! We have to hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.91,1:09:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀，我们偷的是他的直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit! We stealing his ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.28,1:09:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.55,1:09:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说，起飞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, take off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.99,1:09:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,急什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the rush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.86,1:09:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.13,1:09:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,周边已肃清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perimeter secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有区域都已封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}All sectors locked down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.21,1:09:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,安琪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.24,1:09:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.41,1:09:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你不会丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you wouldn't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.45,1:09:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.78,1:09:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discard primary weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.40,1:10:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个展现出无比的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of you showed such promise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.40,1:10:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得看你们动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we had to see you in action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.14,1:10:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你们的必杀技\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most impressive you've been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.84,1:10:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就像兄妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like brother and sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.81,1:10:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,身手无比快速、强壮、敏捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heightened speed, strength, agility. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.88,1:10:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有相同的杀手本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same killer instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.01,1:10:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个同时进行的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parallel strands of research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.32,1:10:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，我们将知道谁比较强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now Now we'll discover which is superior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.45,1:10:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.39,1:10:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.36,1:10:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他决斗，否则他们就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight him, or they die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.63,1:10:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么认为我会在乎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.87,1:10:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸，不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy! Daddy, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.14,1:10:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.61,1:10:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他原本是公司的重要资产\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a valuable asset to the corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.75,1:10:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不在乎这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even care about these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.29,1:11:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.79,1:13:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在突变，把他纳入奈密司计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mutating. I want him in the Nemesis Program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.09,1:13:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.20,1:13:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,细胞结构瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cellular structure breaking down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.00,1:13:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,T病毒出现基因突变\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-virus is manifesting itself in a genetic mutation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.94,1:14:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现相同的细胞再生情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're seeing similar cellular regeneration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.85,1:14:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.42,1:14:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦特，对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Matt. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.82,1:14:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.49,1:14:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你解决他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, finish him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.46,1:14:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.57,1:14:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白你对我有多重要吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand how important you are to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.77,1:14:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪物虽然很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}That creature is one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.34,1:14:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你与T病毒却结合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you somehow you bonded with the T-virus on a cellular level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.24,1:14:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你适应并改变了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You adapted it, changed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.28,1:14:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成了无敌超人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You became magnificent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.81,1:14:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.05,1:14:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.22,1:14:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是突变，你是进化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not mutation. You're evolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.02,1:14:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想有了我帮忙，你会变得多强？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my help, just imagine what you can achieve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.73,1:14:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.16,1:15:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,演化自有其尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evolution has its dead ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.37,1:15:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快解决这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, finish this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.37,1:15:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他死个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him out of his misery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.41,1:15:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.24,1:15:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.18,1:15:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你真失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a disappointment to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.45,1:15:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满力量却不用，真浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that strength，but no will to use it. What a waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.73,1:15:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for takeoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.00,1:15:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我号令开始彻底消毒拉昆市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanitation of Raccoon City to commence on my mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.88,1:15:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.76,1:16:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.64,1:16:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快升空！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us airborne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.30,1:16:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是最高指挥肯恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cain. Priority overload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.47,1:16:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始发射程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiate launch proceedings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.37,1:16:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数五分钟后引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonation set at T-minus 5 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.51,1:16:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,安琪，趴下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angie, get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.36,1:16:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么还不起飞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't we taken off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.66,1:16:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我比较习惯开凯迪拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I usually drive a Cadillac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.48,1:17:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降，否则格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender, or we open fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.61,1:17:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.62,1:18:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.13,1:18:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器投降！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon and surrender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.77,1:18:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把这玩意开上天！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this thing in the air!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.84,1:18:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.35,1:19:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.26,1:19:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.79,1:19:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了，来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.16,1:19:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.54,1:19:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.51,1:19:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别指望我会下跪求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you expect me to beg, I will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.82,1:19:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.66,1:19:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我并不能解决事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing me won't put things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.10,1:19:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.90,1:19:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这至少是个开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's a start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.07,1:21:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to be all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.81,1:21:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家抓稳了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on to something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.69,1:21:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要坠机了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.23,1:22:32.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拉昆市郊亚克雷山区）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.90,1:22:35.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（两小时后）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.70,1:22:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,UG9报告基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}U-Gamma 9 to base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.37,1:22:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认已找到坠机地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmation.We've located the crash site.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.38,1:22:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快派医疗小组过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch the medical team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.69,1:22:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.69,1:23:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发现其他尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}no other bodies found, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.84,1:23:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉昆市的意外有了初步报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have unconfirmed reports of disaster at Raccoon City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.17,1:23:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,本台获得这些骇人的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}These shocking images just in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.41,1:23:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场神秘瘟疫或病毒感染导致局势失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mysterious plague or viral outbreak has run rampant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.31,1:23:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,安布雷拉公司害死无辜平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Implicating Umbrella Corporation in deaths of innocent citizens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.05,1:23:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是拉昆第七台的泰莉所拍摄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This tape, work of former Raccoon 7 anchorwoman Terri Morales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.52,1:23:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,新证据推翻先前的报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}New evidence now discredits earlier reports{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.19,1:23:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示那只是一个恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more than sick joke. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.96,1:23:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,假影带完全被推翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake videotape totally discredited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.99,1:23:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是一个恶作剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more than a big hoax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.90,1:23:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿拉昆市稍早的悲剧来开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing on the very real tragedy which overwhelmed Raccoon City this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.97,1:23:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,核电厂反应炉发生重大意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reactor at the nuclear power station went critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.44,1:23:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自1986年，前苏联切尔诺贝利事件后最大的核子灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst atomic disaster since the Russian Chernobyl incident in 1986.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.31,1:23:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,州长特别致意安布雷拉公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}The state governor personally thanked the Umbrella Corporation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.04,1:23:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢其迅速处理善后\N{\fnArial\fs30}for their swift action{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.48,1:24:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶作剧的吉儿和卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The perpetrators of the hoax, Jill Valentine and Carlos Olivera{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.18,1:24:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前已被警方留置侦讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}now being sought for questioning by the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.42,1:24:09.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拉昆市意外发生三周后）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.69,1:24:12.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安布雷拉医学研究机构）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.10,1:24:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice Alice {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.31,1:24:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.61,1:24:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}wake up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.85,1:24:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得见我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.62,1:24:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听得懂我说的话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.93,1:24:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.53,1:24:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始清洗程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin the purging process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.73,1:25:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她复原的速度惊人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her recovery's remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.63,1:25:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她的力量，不论生理或心理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her powers, both physical and mental{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.47,1:25:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都以等比级数的程度增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}are developing at a geometric rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.45,1:25:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪 哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.08,1:25:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.25,1:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.35,1:25:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很安全，来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe，Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.16,1:25:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.There we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.64,1:26:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.11,1:26:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一支笔，你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pen，You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.88,1:26:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.99,1:26:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.42,1:26:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.76,1:26:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.97,1:26:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.84,1:26:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得你的名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.34,1:26:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.28,1:26:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要她接受全天候的观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her under 24-hour observation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.39,1:26:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.02,1:26:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天结束前还要彻底检测血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}A complete set of blood work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.63,1:26:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有化学及电解质分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chemical and electrolyte analysis by the end of the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.43,1:26:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.36,1:27:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.06,1:27:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.67,1:27:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要做反射作用检测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advanced reflex testing is a priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.83,1:27:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.94,1:27:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,监测她的电子脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monitor electrical impulses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.54,1:27:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.31,1:27:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.21,1:27:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.35,1:27:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.55,1:27:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Alice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.76,1:27:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也记得所有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.02,1:28:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是控制中心，请立刻支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is central. Request immediate backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.26,1:28:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求强力支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maximum response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.24,1:28:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，我们会接手处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, gentlemen. We'll take over from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.80,1:28:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁授权的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On whose authority?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.87,1:28:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.17,1:28:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,第六级授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level six authorization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.65,1:28:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.24,1:29:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.51,1:30:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能回来真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to have you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.65,1:30:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.75,1:30:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝计划启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Program Alice activated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.56,1:30:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.23,1:32:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,本产品由安布雷拉公司出品\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a product of the Umbrella Corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.47,1:32:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们热爱生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our business is life itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.37,1:32:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some side effects may occur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.51,1:32:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,未完，待续 请期待生化危机3\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be continue Resident Evil Ⅲ{\r}
